Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:46:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FORK-20, part 3: the list widget of mod screens

A scrolling list (list: x, y, w, h, row_height, first, count, on_click, source text/items) shows count rows of the menu text from string first, scrolls by the wheel or by dragging, and a click that is not a drag on row i sends menu button on_click + i.

